        "original_id": "f9a15007-cda5-5fcf-8b9d-1aecbfff8b70",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack Binion, Benny Binion\n- Organizations: Poker Hall of Fame\n- Places: Dallas, Texas; Las Vegas, Nevada\n- Companies: Binion's Horseshoe, Horseshoe Casino\n- Topics: gambling, poker\n\nFacts:\n- Benny Binion was born on November 20, 1904, and died on December 25, 1989.\n- Benny Binion was an American gambling icon and mob boss.\n- The Poker Hall of Fame was created in Las Vegas in 1979 by Benny Binion, the owner of the Horseshoe Casino.\n- The Poker Hall of Fame was created to preserve the names and legacies of the world's greatest poker players and to serve as a tourist attraction to Benny Binion's casino.\n- Jack Benny Binion was born on February 21, 1937, in Dallas, Texas.\n- Jack Binion is an American businessman.\n- Jack Binion is the son of casino magnate Benny Binion.\n- Jack Binion worked for his father at Binion's Horseshoe, a casino and hotel in Las Vegas, Nevada.",
